<title>FINLAND: Finnish 2006 bond yields 5.88 pct at auction.</title>
<headline>Finnish 2006 bond yields 5.88 pct at auction.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue of the S1/96 bond was announced by the State Treasury Office.</p>
<p> ISSUER:				 Republic of Finland</p>
<p> MATURITY:			     18-04-2006</p>
<p> COUPON:				 7.25 PCT</p>
<p> AUCTION YIELD:			5.88 PCT</p>
<p> PRICE:				  109.15</p>
<p> AUCTION AMOUNT			FIM 1,445 MLN</p>
<p> BID AMOUNT:			   FIM 1,635 MLN</p>
<p> PAYMENT FREQUENCY:		  YEARLY</p>
<p>NOTES: After this auction, the outstanding amount is 27,584 million markka.</p>
<p>The previous auction of the bond raised 3,333 million markka at a price of 106.35 and a yield of 6.29 percent.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0240, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
